---
import GenericPageLayout from '../../layouts/GenericPageLayout.astro';
import styles from '../../styles/about.module.css';
---

<GenericPageLayout 
  title="Campus Security & Safety" 
  subtitle="Ensuring a peaceful and secure academic environment."
  heroImage="/media/DSC_4804.webp"
  breadcrumbs={[
    { label: 'Campus', href: '/campus' },
    { label: 'Security', href: '/campus/security' }
  ]}
>
  <div class={styles.contentWrapper}>
    <h2 class={styles.heading2}>University Security Division</h2>
    <p class={styles.paragraph}>
      The safety of our students, staff, and infrastructural assets is the absolute highest priority. The FUAZ Security Division works in tandem with state law enforcement agencies to maintain a completely secure campus perimeter 24/7.
    </p>

    <h2 class={styles.heading2}>Security Measures</h2>
    <ul class={styles.list}>
      <li><strong>Access Control:</strong> All students MUST visibly wear their university ID cards to gain access to the campus through the main gate. Vehicles must display valid FUAZ permit stickers.</li>
      <li><strong>CCTV Surveillance:</strong> Administrative zones, library floors, and examination halls are continuously monitored by high-definition CCTV systems.</li>
      <li><strong>Emergency Rapid Response:</strong> A motorized patrol unit is stationed at the hostel blocks to respond rapidly to any localized incidents.</li>
    </ul>

    <div class={styles.importantBox}>
      <strong>Curfew Notice:</strong> The university gate strictly closes by 10:00 PM. Students living off-campus must ensure they exit the premises before this time.
    </div>
  </div>
</GenericPageLayout>
